    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2NrsjZR67sYLkLtKqkMhftf)_\n\nIndependent of #316 and #317 (touches other files).\n\n## What\n- `sp-helper-funct`: removed `sia-denote-link-description-title-case` (nothing called it; it needs `denote-*` functions).\n- `sp-academic`: removed the `citar-org-node` package, since `org-node` is no longer loaded; comments now say literature notes use `citar-vulpea`.\n- Literate docs `sp-helper-funct.org` and `sp-academic.org` updated to match.\n\n## Kept on purpose\n- `sp-author-notes` (converts old `denote:` links to ID links) and the Denote name cleaning in `sp-notes`: they migrate existing notes.\n- `sp-org-node-mem.el` is not in `init.el`; left as it is, say if you want it deleted.\n- `sp-search` `org-node-grep` entry (guarded by `fboundp`) and `(dg-use-denote nil)` in `sp-graphs`: harmless.\n\n## Testing\n- Docs tangle to the committed `.el` (ignoring whitespace). No test touches these functions.\n- /untested/ with Elpaca and the real config.\n- No CHANGELOG edit.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi9hnWskPJso94gsTkL)_",
